---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Modern modular homes | ma modular" description="ma is an architect-designed modern modular home system built with high-quality materials and delivered at an affordable price. From KRDB, Austin.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-frame">
      <img src="/images/site/home-1.webp" srcset="/images/site/home-1-640.webp 640w, /images/site/home-1.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" width="1280" height="808" alt="A modern modular house at dusk with a glowing wall of glass." fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="hero-overlay">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Architect-designed modern homes, built in a factory.</h1>
        <p>Modular homes and ADUs from KRDB.</p>
        <p class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-orange" href="/find-your-ma/">Find your ma</a> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Tell us about your lot</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap rows">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>what is <span class="o">ma</span>?</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is an architect designed modern modular homes system built with high quality materials—and delivered to you at an affordable price. Our mission at <span class="o">ma</span> is to make modern design accessible.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/site/home-2.webp" srcset="/images/site/home-2-640.webp 640w, /images/site/home-2.webp 1090w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 600px" width="1090" height="727" alt="Dogtrot living and dining room with floor-to-ceiling glass and a screened porch, looking out to the trees." loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="row flip">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>why <span class="o">ma</span>?</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is <strong>faster</strong>—roughly half the time it takes to build a home ground up.</p>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is <strong>quality</strong> built in a controlled environment. No exposure to natural elements = a tighter build.</p>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is <strong>affordable</strong>—compared to a typical architect designed home.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/site/home-3.webp" srcset="/images/site/home-3-640.webp 640w, /images/site/home-3.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 500px" width="960" height="1183" alt="Kitchen and dining area with colored chairs." loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>where is <span class="o">ma</span>?</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> is a design firm, specializing in volumetric modular architecture. We do not have our own factory; rather, we partner with factories that are as geographically convenient to the project as possible. We currently have relationships with factories covering a majority of the contiguous states.</p>
        <p>Please fill out our <a class="o" href="/contact/">contact form</a> to find out if we have a factory for your project.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/site/home-4.webp" width="750" height="559" alt="A Luna house with a cedar wall, glass sliding doors and a wood deck, with a family on the deck." loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="strip">
    <div class="wrap strip-grid">
      <div class="strip-col">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26"/><path d="M24 26c0-5 4-8 8-8s8 3 8 8c0 6-8 6-8 12"/><circle cx="32" cy="46" r="1.5"/></svg>
        <h2>myths</h2>
        <p>There are a lot of misconceptions about modular construction. Some are true, some are not. Let’s demystify them…</p>
        <a href="/myths/">Read the myths</a>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-col">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="18" width="36" height="28" rx="3"/><path d="M42 29l16-9v24l-16-9z"/></svg>
        <h2>videos</h2>
        <p>See project sets, factory tours, interviews with principals, clients and more…</p>
        <a href="/videos/">Watch Now</a>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-col">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 56V12h26v44M40 26h12v30M8 56h48M21 20h6M21 29h6M21 38h6M21 47h6M45 35h2M45 44h2"/></svg>
        <h2>development projects</h2>
        <p><span class="o">ma</span> partners with development teams to create projects from single-family homes to 150,000+ sq. ft. mixed use.</p>
        <a href="/multi-family/">See all development projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a class="ma-banner" href="/find-your-ma/" aria-label="Find your ma: see all fourteen plans">
    <img src="/images/site/find-ma-banner.webp" srcset="/images/site/find-ma-banner-1200.webp 1200w, /images/site/find-ma-banner.webp 2400w" sizes="100vw" width="2400" height="393" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <span>find your ma</span>
  </a>

  <nav class="press-row" aria-label="Press">
    <a href="http://www.dwell.com/post/article/ma-dular-building-austin"><img src="/images/press/dwell.webp" width="400" height="147" alt="Dwell" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="http://www.decoist.com/2012-08-27/8-modular-home-designs-with-modern-flair/"><img src="/images/press/decoist.webp" width="400" height="137" alt="Decoist" loading="lazy" /></a>
    <a href="https://www.thrillist.com/home/best-modular-home-builders-on-the-market-diy-home-building"><img src="/images/press/thrillist.webp" width="400" height="98" alt="Thrillist" loading="lazy" /></a>
  </nav>
</Base>
